OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning decision success
OL,4,Aimproving, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut at a council meeting on Tuesday, it
OL,7,Fwas revealed the council was aware of
OL,8,Fits situation and had been working to
OL,9,Fimprove its process before being
OL,10,Fdesignated.
